1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 17=

3
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,360
Hello?

4
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:42,960
(Is this He Lan's family?)

5
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,400
Yes.

6
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,720
(Come over right away.)

7
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,200
(We've managed to save him.)

8
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,480
Okay. I'm on my way.

9
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,160
His vital signs are stable for now.

10
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,360
But we can't say

11
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:00,480
whether there'll be complications later.

12
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,120
It's too early to tell.

13
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,880
We'll monitor him closely.

14
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,440
He's still in a deep coma.

15
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,840
Whether he'll wake up,

16
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,960
and when,

17
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:11,040
we can't say for sure.

18
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,600
But he will wake up, right?

19
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,680
All I can say is

20
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,200
we've done everything we can.

21
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:19,600
The rest depends on his will to survive.

22
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:24,960
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

23
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,240
How could you do something so stupid?

24
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,040
You knew he was trying to kill you.

25
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,800
Why did you turn your back on him?

26
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,640
You've saved me so many times.

27
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,360
You're just sleeping,

28
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,680
right?

29
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:51,800
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

30
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:55,080
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

31
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:58,960
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

32
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,800
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

33
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:05,920
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

34
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,800
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

35
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:12,200
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

36
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,600
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

37
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:18,600
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

38
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:22,680
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

39
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,480
♪I could give you another future♪

40
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,000
Ever since we met,

41
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,200
I've done nothing but cause you trouble.

42
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:34,480
Even when you're hurt,
you still rush in to save me.

43
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,120
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

44
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,880
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

45
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,160
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

46
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,440
This ring...

47
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,120
you said it's a family heirloom.

48
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,960
Now I, Luo Xiyu,

49
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,760
want to be your wife.

50
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,400
Will you let me?

51
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:01,080
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

52
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,880
I'm rushing things.

53
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,200
It's okay.

54
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:08,080
I'll tell you myself when you wake up.

55
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:11,640
Li Junsheng is still at large.

56
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,680
♪I choose you in every lifetime
and every day♪

57
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,880
As long as he's still alive,

58
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,520
I'm destined to die on April 4.

59
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,640
You promised

60
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:24,480
you'd always protect me.

61
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,320
♪If every time I wake up♪

62
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:29,280
You won't leave me alone, right?

63
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:36,640
♪Then let me fall♪

64
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:39,640
♪Fall all over again♪

65
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:42,360
♪Fall♪

66
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,360
(Visiting hours are over.)

67
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,600
(The patient needs rest.)

68
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,880
Get some rest.

69
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,720
I'll come see you again.

70
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,280
(He's not someone
I'm meant to stay away from.)

71
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,400
(From the very beginning,)

72
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:32,480
(our fates have been
tightly intertwined.)

73
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,520
(After He Lan came back
from the brink of death,)

74
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,240
(I started to believe)

75
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,680
(that miracles really can happen.)

76
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,520
(But...)

77
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:45,000
(how do I explain the vision)

78
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,480
(of He Lan lying dead
under a white sheet?)

79
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,360
(He Lan didn't die.)

80
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,520
(Does that mean)

81
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,520
(I won't die again either?)

82
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,200
What's wrong?

83
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,600
Does it taste bad?

84
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,760
You're still recovering,

85
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,080
so porridge is all you can have.

86
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,240
It's not bad.

87
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,840
If you're the one feeding me,

88
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,880
anything tastes good.

89
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,960
Such a sweet talker.

90
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,000
I made you worry these past few days.

91
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,720
I'm sorry.

92
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,120
He Lan,

93
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,120
propose to me.

94
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,320
Right now?

95
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,160
You don't want to?

96
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,040
It's not that I don't want to.

97
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,640
I just think

98
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,520
this is too rushed.

99
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,760
I haven't prepared anything.

100
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,320
Actually,

101
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,520
a proposal only needs three things.

102
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,560
You,

103
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,080
me,

104
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:26,800
and...

105
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,840
This ring.

106
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,000
Xiyu,

107
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,480
from the moment I first saw you,

108
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,760
I knew you were the one
I wanted to spend my life with.

109
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,240
Will you marry me?

110
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,120
♪I miss you♪

111
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,600
No matter what the future brings,

112
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,040
poverty,

113
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,480
illness, or whatever life
throws at us...

114
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:23,960
♪I'm already hooked♪

115
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:26,360
♪Falling for you has become a habit♪

116
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,360
I will.

117
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:32,920
♪The traces you left on my heart remain♪

118
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:36,280
♪No busy signal can drown them out♪

119
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:41,720
♪No cold night wind can blow them away♪

120
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:46,480
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

121
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,800
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

122
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:54,920
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

123
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,440
Did I...

124
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,640
Did I aggravate your wound?

125
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,360
Lie down.

126
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,320
♪All my pain♪

127
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,160
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

128
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,200
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

129
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,960
♪It's all just my imagination♪

130
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,720
♪I dreamed up every little moment♪

131
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,520
♪The sweetness was never even real♪

132
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,080
♪I became hysterical♪

133
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:21,640
♪And little by little, I lost myself♪

134
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,760
♪Completely♪

135
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,960
♪Your greatest magic is my weakness♪

136
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,440
♪I just can't control myself♪

137
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,400
We're in the hospital.

138
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,360
♪That's why I keep falling♪

139
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,280
♪For a love that was never real♪

140
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,520
I'm worried you won't sleep well
on the couch.

141
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,280
Share the bed with me tonight.

142
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:38,000
♪I still ended up completely defeated♪

143
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,280
I don't want to disturb your rest.

144
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,200
If you toss and turn over there,

145
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:44,240
that will keep me up.

146
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,760
Besides...

147
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,200
you're already Mrs. He.

148
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,760
What's there to worry about?

149
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:55,000
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

150
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:58,400
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

151
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:04,400
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

152
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:08,960
♪I swallowed every lie♪

153
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:12,360
♪And forgot how cold you became♪

154
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:15,000
♪All my pain♪

155
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,280
Morning rounds.

156
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,000
I figured you hadn't had breakfast,

157
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,280
so I stood in line

158
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,080
and got you some soup dumplings.

159
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,480
Great. Thanks.

160
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,200
The couch wasn't very comfortable,

161
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,760
so we shared the bed last night.

162
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,520
Your nose...

163
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:34,560
Huh?

164
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,520
You've got a little inflammation.

165
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,160
Here.

166
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,600
Looks like wedding bells
are coming soon.

167
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,840
Congratulations.

168
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,720
Judging by those dark circles,

169
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,160
you pulled another all-nighter
in surgery, didn't you?

170
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,280
And we still made you get us breakfast.

171
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,920
Feels like we're wasting

172
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,040
valuable medical resources here.

173
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,360
The nurse said you're
being discharged tomorrow.

174
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,200
To celebrate me getting a position here

175
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,160
and you getting discharged safely,

176
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:58,840
how about this?

177
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,240
Lunch is on me tomorrow.

178
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,440
My treat.

179
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:02,520
You got the position?

180
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,440
Yeah.

181
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,360
The results were just posted.

182
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,040
(In my previous life,)

183
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,160
(the day after the hospital
posted the results,)

184
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,760
(Wang Haotian injured
Zhang Jinghang's hand,)

185
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,280
(and he could never operate again.)

186
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,600
(This time around,)

187
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,400
(Zhang Jinghang can finally
fulfill his dream)

188
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,880
(and stand at the operating table.)

189
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,000
Congratulations.

190
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,120
You finally made your dream come true.

191
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:27,720
And...

192
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:28,800
about what happened

193
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,160
at the funeral,

194
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,560
I owe you both an apology.

195
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,720
I know

196
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,720
Li Junsheng is the one I should blame.

197
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,680
I shouldn't have said those things
to you.

198
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,280
It's all in the past now.

199
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,080
Things will get better.

200
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,360
All right.

201
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,440
I'll let you get some rest.

202
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,240
See you tomorrow.

203
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,080
Wait.

204
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:47,440
Um...

205
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,000
send me the location.

206
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,600
I have to stop by the Dance Company
tomorrow,

207
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,040
so I'll head straight there afterward.

208
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,160
It's close to the Dance Company.

209
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,600
I have to pick up Song Shuqi anyway,

210
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,840
so we'll pick you up too.

211
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,200
I'll send the location to He Lan.

212
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,480
We'll meet at the restaurant.

213
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,160
Okay.

214
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:39,800
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

215
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:46,360
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

216
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:50,480
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

217
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:53,640
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

218
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,560
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

219
00:12:56,560 --> 00:13:00,040
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

220
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:06,280
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

221
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:12,840
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

222
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:16,120
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

223
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:20,000
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

224
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,840
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

225
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:26,960
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

226
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,840
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

227
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:33,240
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

228
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,640
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

229
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:39,640
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

230
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:43,720
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

231
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:46,760
♪I could give you another future♪

232
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:53,200
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

233
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:55,520
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

234
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:57,160
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

235
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,920
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

236
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:01,200
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

237
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:05,200
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

238
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:09,160
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
